 {:db/id "q-96084/ma-source-field/e711361ac895e16de559af3c79ac21a3b7ab4a7c0fee86eeaffbb9c5ecda6063" :answer-field/id #uuid "fd5aaa14-82c5-5b2c-8c17-18030cfdb9c7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["q-96084/ma-source-field/e711361ac895e16de559af3c79ac21a3b7ab4a7c0fee86eeaffbb9c5ecda6063/4402a818c60bd464339a4d9c76357a0b31b75656ad1ac95fe5a1ff8804028d7e" "q-96084/ma-source-field/e711361ac895e16de559af3c79ac21a3b7ab4a7c0fee86eeaffbb9c5ecda6063/756caf8fd3453ecaae1240d575da1d4bbd085d792cd0fa784450aba51f8d776e" "q-96084/ma-source-field/e711361ac895e16de559af3c79ac21a3b7ab4a7c0fee86eeaffbb9c5ecda6063/b06ed78f6dedc9653a9d972584a4a52b65f74795851da280e18b865394af8035" "q-96084/ma-source-field/e711361ac895e16de559af3c79ac21a3b7ab4a7c0fee86eeaffbb9c5ecda6063/30a03eeea22fc940a96b89dfa41e287665627931d695481ce91defb00af9ad5f" "q-96084/ma-source-field/e711361ac895e16de559af3c79ac21a3b7ab4a7c0fee86eeaffbb9c5ecda6063/80c84081396b73cfa7f133e42082b209c9927871f21dd1dc699df69185f543b5"] :answer-field/correct "q-96084/ma-source-field/e711361ac895e16de559af3c79ac21a3b7ab4a7c0fee86eeaffbb9c5ecda6063/b06ed78f6dedc9653a9d972584a4a52b65f74795851da280e18b865394af8035" :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]}
 {:db/id "q-96084" :question/id #uuid "9d0bc05c-84b7-5858-84df-86a5d9c6d43e" :question/math-academy-id "q-96084" :question/problem "What type of quadratic curve is defined by the following equation?\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}^{2}-4{x}_{2}=0\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we complete the squares for the variable ${x}_{2}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}^{2}-4{x}_{2} & =0 \\\\ {x}_{1}+2({x}_{2}^{2}-2{x}_{2}) & =0 \\\\ {x}_{1}+2({x}_{2}^{2}-2{x}_{2}+1-1) & =0 \\\\ {x}_{1}+2({x}_{2}-1)^{2}-2 & =0 \\\\ 2({x}_{2}-1)^{2} & =-({x}_{1}-2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, performing the change of variables\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{y}_{1}={x}_{1}-2, \\\\ {y}_{2}={x}_{2}-1,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwe get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{y}_{2}^{2} & =-{y}_{1} \\\\ {y}_{2}^{2} & =-\\frac{1}{2}{y}_{1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nThis represents a parabola that opens in the direction of the negative ${y}_{1}$-axis." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-96084/ma-source-field/e711361ac895e16de559af3c79ac21a3b7ab4a7c0fee86eeaffbb9c5ecda6063"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]}
